For your next archeologist :-).  I would have given you the advice to do 
the quest.  The archeologist's quest is pretty easy and I have always 
found it contains a lot of loot (as appropriate for an archeologist); 
many rings for example, so you had a decent chance of finding 
levitation.  There is a slight chance that a wand of death may turn up 
and kill you, if a monster has it, but then you could not expect to get 
by without any risk in your situation.

As to the arch-lich, you might have swung at him standing on the 
staircase, after engraving Elbereth.  With Mjollnir, you should have 
been able to kill him, unless the monsters he summoned forced you to 
retreat upstairs (where you would have needed another Elbereth, presumably).

